<title>SOUTH KOREA: S.Korea's Samsung to close naphtha cracker Tuesday.</title>
<headline>S.Korea's Samsung to close naphtha cracker Tuesday.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korea's Samsung General Chemicals Co, an unlisted affiliate of Samsung Group, said on Monday it would close its 500,000 tonnes-a-year naphtha cracking centre on Tuesday for annual maintenance.</p>
<p>The unit is expected to resume operation on May 6, a company spokesman said.</p>
<p>--Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5643</p>
</text>
